positions.description:
Lead Scrum dailies; build proofs of concept; create and/or revisit UML diagrams; help Business Analysts to register and understand the customer’s needs; elaborate and evaluate proposals and mockups using different technologies according to the customer's platform; create test’s planning;
In the middle stage: evaluate the approved solution, introduce and establish design patterns and best practices to development team, schedule, manage issues and bug`s reports; 
In the final stage: create deliverables, evaluate integrated tests and builds, support product installation.

